Author: yagaltd <yagaltd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Mon Sep 28 14:44:41 2026 +0700

    feat(apply): opt-in task boundary gate via plan_task allowed
    
    - union-of-allowed constrains the whole apply; violations fail the task
      with the violating paths as retry evidence
    - diff = tracked + untracked via one approved command, surfaced in
      plan_report so /dc-apply includes it in the suite
    - inert without declarations; loud degradation when the diff is
      unavailable; .pi/deepclause/ state exempt
    - planner validates (relative globs only) and emits the field
    - tests/boundary.test.ts: adversarial probe against a real git repo
    - dogfooded as change boundary-guard: 4/4 tasks verified, status OK

